    <briefdescription>
<para>Detect blobs in image (specialized for dynamic obstacles in the costmap) </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class is based on OpenCV&apos;s blob detector cv::SimpleBlobDetector. It has been modified and specialized for dynamic obstacle tracking in the costmap: -&gt; The modified version also returns contours of the blob.</para>
<para>See <ulink url="http://docs.opencv.org/trunk/d0/d7a/classcv_1_1SimpleBlobDetector.html">http://docs.opencv.org/trunk/d0/d7a/classcv_1_1SimpleBlobDetector.html</ulink> for the original class. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
